    "sections": {
        "description": "The Wheel Alignment Service Theme is a modern, feature-rich, and fully responsive website template designed for car repair shops, auto service centers, mobile car repair businesses, garages, auto body repair shops, tire shops, and automotive service providers. Tailored for auto mechanics, certified technicians, vehicle repair experts, and garage owners, it delivers a sleek, professional, and easy-to-navigate design that enhances user engagement and builds trust. Perfect for services like wheel alignment, tire balancing, tire repair, brake pad replacement, brake inspection, suspension repair, car diagnostics, oil changes, engine repair, battery replacement, roadside assistance, tire rotation, vehicle detailing, and transmission repair, this theme ensures every offering is presented in a clean, organized, and visually appealing way. Built for car maintenance professionals, it includes strategically placed call-to-action (CTA) buttons, service sections, mechanic profiles, testimonials, pricing tables, emergency repair highlights, and location-based service listings to drive conversions. Optimized for SEO, speed, and mobile responsiveness, it provides smooth navigation across devices and is ideal for local automotive businesses wanting to grow their online presence. Its modern layout, interactive service showcases, high-resolution image support, Google Maps integration, social media links, booking forms, and customer review sections create a comprehensive digital solution. Fully compatible with the Mechanic Services Booking plugin, it streamlines appointment scheduling, service booking, and client management for maximum efficiency. This versatile theme is perfect for auto workshops, tire alignment businesses, car service garages, mobile mechanics, vehicle diagnostics companies, and automotive brands looking for a scalable, conversion-focused, and visually stunning online platform. https://demo.asterthemes.com/docs/wheel-alignment-service-pro/"
    },
